2026-07-27T11:42:44.2509716Z i /tmp/RtmpTDGAcu/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:42:44.2510114Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:42:44.2510632Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:42:44.2511093Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:42:44.2512195Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:42:44.2513417Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:42:44.2514446Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
